00:00:15,795 --> 00:00:23,680
69 Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow.

2
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:27,510
We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning.

3
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:31,640
He will be in his small boat, Topsail.

4
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,970
Topsail is a famous little boat.

5
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:39,480
It has sailed acr oss the Atlantic many times.

6
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:46,000
Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock, so we'll have plenty of time.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,160
We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him.

8
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:53,090
He will be away for two months.

9
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,910
We are very proud of him.

10
00:00:55,910 --> 00:01:04,326
He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic.
